Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.23,0:00:05.73,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I want time off. I wanna go on a trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:08.73,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I want a dip in the hot springs...!
