Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.73,0:00:12.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Time off? We just got done with New Year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:16.00,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,New Year's is over by the time you finish \Nvisiting your family and doing other stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.76,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,They should extend it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:18.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Simmer down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:22.87,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You and Katase-san would love to \Nrecuperate in a hot springs too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:26.89,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Under a pristine sky, \Nsurrounded by nature's beauty...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.89,0:00:29.85,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Listening to the chirping of \Nbirds and babbling of rivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.85,0:00:32.88,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,relaxing as you soak in hot water...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.88,0:00:36.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It sounds like paradise for office workers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.36,0:00:39.06,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She's captured Senpai's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.44,0:00:42.77,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It's not a physical thing. \NI need to warm up mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.77,0:00:46.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I get you... I really get you, Hayakawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:49.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll have a cat on the premises...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:54.27,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Relief from this jungle of concrete \Nunderneath nothing but blue lights...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.27,0:00:57.82,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No good! Senpai's all the way off \Nin fantasy land!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:01:00.12,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Do you seriously wanna go \Nat the end of the month?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:02.08,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,On a weekday, using paid vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.08,0:01:04.46,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That sounds really, really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:06.04,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You wanna come, too, Shinozaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.72,0:01:08.78,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It'd be kind of weird for me to tag along...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.78,0:01:11.96,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna catch a glimpse of \Nyour senpai, fresh out of the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.19,0:01:16.57,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I just got out of the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.97,0:01:19.67,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I can't deny that, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.67,0:01:22.52,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,If I take time off, too, work might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:23.82,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.23,0:01:25.76,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:27.73,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,We're in a slow period at the moment anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.73,0:01:30.81,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,And paid vacation is \Nmeant to be used, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.81,0:01:32.86,Main,Shiori/Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:36.03,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,In that case, why don't you come, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.57,0:01:37.66,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It'd be a little awkward being the only guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:42.96,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That sounds nice! Let's all go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I bet it'd be more fun with the whole gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.48,0:01:47.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Right, Hayakawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.08,0:01:49.67,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.39,0:01:53.42,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,All of us, on a trip to the hot springs...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:54.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.99,0:01:56.39,Main,Shjiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.25,0:01:56.58,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mm-hm, mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.08,0:01:58.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Hayakawa...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.33,0:02:00.14,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Sh-Shinozaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.48,0:02:00.11,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mm-hm, mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:02.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.03,0:02:03.43,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Katase-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.44,0:02:03.98,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mm-hm, mm-hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:06.48,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mm-hm, mm-hm!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.48,0:02:08.97,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,This is gonna be awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.97,0:02:09.88,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:12.39,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Can't you be normal about this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.41,0:02:20.09,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:29.71,Show_Title,Title sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H292A2F&\bord0}My {\1a&HFF&\bord1\3c&HA183CA&}T{\3c&H000000&}iny {\bord0\1a&H00&}Senpai
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.46,0:02:32.79,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}We've got an emergency here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.57,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Are you paying attention, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:41.80,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's someone other than me \Ndancing around inside of my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:44.05,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}I want to talk to her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.10,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}I want to touch her
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:52.59,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Look, I get it, but for now try to pipe down
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:55.82,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}What in the world am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:58.57,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're right next to me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:04.82,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}And this is the perfect chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:06.40,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.40,0:03:11.11,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm trapped by that sweet rich taste
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:14.32,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}And I don't think I can ever escape
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.32,0:03:16.82,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}I may as well just sink into it
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:17.65,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}HONEY
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.65,0:03:22.43,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's another day in your dazzling presence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:25.43,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}We may never be \Non the same page with this love but
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:31.86,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, I love you so much, I just have to laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:46.95,Episode_Title,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,450)\an1\pos(38,310)}#08 {\fscx80}Isn't It Time for Good Boys to Go to {\c&H8F73DE&}Sleep{\c}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.24,0:03:50.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What a nice, charming inn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:54.00,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,And we'd normally be \Nworking at a time like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:56.43,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Thank you, paid time off!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.52,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'll go get us checked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.51,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:04.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I appreciate you handling \Nthe reservations and the drive, Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.97,0:04:08.01,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,No sweat. I enjoy that kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.86,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Besides, Katase-san \Nand I shared driving duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:13.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I was kind of surprised \Nto find out she can drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:16.74,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe I should get my license this year...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.33,0:04:18.27,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.27,0:04:21.93,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,That way, she can \Nride shotgun with you next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:24.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I wasn't trying to—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.28,0:04:27.13,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That was Senpai's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:29.29,Sign_Basic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\c&H000000&\3c&HE6CD95&\fs10\shad0\frz349.8\fax-.2\pos(149.334,76.667)}The {\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3A0CD5&}Criminal {\c&H000000&\3c&HE6CD95&}And\Nthe {\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3A0CD5&}Hot Springs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:29.29,Sign_Basic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\c&H7959AA&\3c&HE6CD95&\fs8\bord1\b1\shad0\fax-.2\frz353.3\pos(236.667,202.667)}Murder Hidden in\Nthe Hot Springs Steam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.32,0:04:29.29,Sign_Basic,Signs,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs10\shad0\3c&H565F68&\bord1\frz12.89\frx2\fry6\pos(80,200)}Mystery of the {\c&H5E34C6&}Hot Springs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.13,0:04:29.29,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,D-Did something happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.54,0:04:32.29,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:39.68,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'm in fluffy wuffy kitty witty paradise...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:41.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It was a scream of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:44.60,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,They say you can tell if an inn \Nis good when it has cats, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:46.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Nice one, Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.40,0:04:48.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Come right this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:50.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:56.56,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What a complete lack of popularity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:59.63,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Maybe they're too similar to like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:01.36,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}So Senpai's a cat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:07.11,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come to think if it, I don't think I've \Never seen her successfully pet a cat...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.65,0:05:09.24,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What do you think, Hayakawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:11.24,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You talking to meow, Shinozaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.24,0:05:12.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,A living cat tower?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:15.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Is her body made out of catnip or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:22.72,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I heard this place had a hot springs pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.38,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,But this is pretty huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.38,0:05:27.23,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Pretty nice, right? \NA pool for the middle of winter!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:28.80,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Let's swim plenty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.16,0:05:33.32,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I never imagined getting to see Senpai \Nin a swimsuit in the middle of winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.06,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Thank you, Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:41.07,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Senpai's swimsuit... Will it be cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.20,0:05:45.29,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or maybe classy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.07,0:05:48.65,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.67,0:05:51.45,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Right over here, Katase-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:53.95,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sorry about the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.44,0:06:03.94,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She went with a mature style?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.42,0:06:07.42,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}No good! At the end of the day, \Nshe's my senpai from work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.69,0:06:10.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Gotta stay calm! Restrain those dirty thoughts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.33,0:06:13.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Go with a casual compliment...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:15.43,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,You both look wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:17.40,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:18.44,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:19.69,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.69,0:06:21.94,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was flawless, and he made it look easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:25.69,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I even say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.50,0:06:28.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}You really does look nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:29.61,Sign_Basic,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(180,285)\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFDFFFD&\shad0}Chickening out with a safe approach
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:35.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.37,0:06:37.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She covered up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I suddenly feel really self-conscious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:45.88,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe we're at the pool and I \Ndon't get to see Senpai in a bathing suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.40,0:06:48.87,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe I should just ask her to show it to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.35,0:06:51.89,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}No, that'd be sexual harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.48,0:06:58.36,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \Nwhat's with the inner tube?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.36,0:07:00.41,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I bought it just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.41,0:07:01.48,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,You work fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.92,0:07:06.65,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Okay, Manager, let's head \Nto the river pool with that inner tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.65,0:07:08.00,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:08.81,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The river pool...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.00,0:07:08.81,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come on, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.81,0:07:09.53,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:13.63,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}That's right! If we get in the pool, \NI'll naturally get to see the swimsuit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.20,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fs20\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFDFFFD&\shad0\pos(320,300)}IQ reduced to 3 by impure thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:15.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8\i1}Good job, Hayakawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:17.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.20,0:07:19.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You all can go on and have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.52,0:07:24.09,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She must really not want me to look at her...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:27.59,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}The problem is that I can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:30.14,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Th-Then maybe the wave pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.14,0:07:31.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You all can go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.26,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,The kiddie pool...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.26,0:07:34.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:45.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, can you not swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.98,0:07:52.54,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's not that I can't. \NIt's just that I never have before!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.54,0:07:54.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That would mean that you can't, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:02.50,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Sorry! I shouldn't make fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.05,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,I want ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:07.63,Main,Mother,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's go ask dad, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.22,0:08:09.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,When I was little... \NI went into the deep end of the pool,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:12.09,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,lost my footing, and almost drowned...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:15.48,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I've had trouble with it ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.89,0:08:19.39,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Round and around and around—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:19.39,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I do think that it looks like fun, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.43,0:08:19.39,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,{\an8}Manager, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.16,0:08:24.86,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,In that case, do you want to go in together?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.63,0:08:29.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm tall enough that I can stand on the bottom,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.15,0:08:31.21,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,and we can watch out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.18,0:08:39.22,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.32,0:08:45.12,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,This is warmer than I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:47.37,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.37,0:08:48.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Not at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.90,0:08:52.13,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I almost feel like I could \Nstart swimming already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:08:59.03,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Shinozaki-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.03,0:08:59.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:04.02,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's trying so hard! \NCast out those wicked thoughts, me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.88,0:09:08.51,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Could you teach me how to swim now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.51,0:09:10.27,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:14.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,For starters, \Ntry putting your face into the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.15,0:09:18.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Got it! Watch me! Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:22.91,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She might actually figure this out quickly—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.13,0:09:26.42,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.75,0:09:31.47,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I can normally put my face underwater \Nwith no problem... What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.47,0:09:34.05,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You're probably nervous \Nbecause of the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.52,0:09:36.93,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe if you imagine \Nyou're in the bath, it'll be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.93,0:09:41.26,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bath, the bath, the bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.33,0:09:45.85,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's acting like a cat that hates bathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:48.81,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe submerging your face \Nis a little too much to start with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.25,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.25,0:09:54.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,It's okay. Let's start with an inner tube \Nand have you practice swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:55.86,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'll go buy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.68,0:10:00.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.36,0:10:03.74,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not good! I've got a cramp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.74,0:10:06.60,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I got careless because the water's so shallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Someone... help...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.37,0:10:16.76,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:19.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpa—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:22.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Live!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.63,0:10:25.18,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I'm okay! I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:26.62,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.62,0:10:28.10,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,All good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:34.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:41.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I thought you might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:47.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No, it's okay! I'm feeling great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:50.08,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Don't worry! You can relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.08,0:10:51.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.28,0:10:52.90,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,More importantly, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.96,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You just swam.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:11:02.41,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! That's not more important!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.59,0:11:02.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:05.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Huh... dizzy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.68,0:11:07.47,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Had I not caught my breath yet?...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.60,0:11:10.73,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I-I can't fall...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:21.07,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Th...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.07,0:11:23.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.16,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.17,0:11:36.67,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,L-Let me retie that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:41.93,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:44.89,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}There.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:45.85,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sneak...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:46.93,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nobody saw that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:48.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:52.44,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry! I don't know \Nhow to make it up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.32,0:11:56.28,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is that all you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:12:00.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,D-Do you want me to bow?! \NOr maybe a written apology?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.24,0:12:03.30,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Never mind, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Sulk...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:06.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:21.14,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\i1}My Tiny Senpai{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:26.44,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I took a dip in the baths already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.97,0:12:34.98,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Oooh, that hits the spot...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.61,0:12:39.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I can feel the exhaustion washing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.50,0:12:43.84,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Christmas, the end of the year, \Nand then New Year's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:46.89,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I think Japan might cram too many \Nevents into such small a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:52.75,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,But I do feel really refreshed after today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:56.46,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting me, Hayakawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:58.50,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,No, thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.35,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,If it was just me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.35,0:13:04.82,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I would've probably just whined about wanting \Nto go and never actually done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:10.01,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,And I definitely wouldn't have done \Nanything as active as playing in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.12,0:13:18.02,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I guess so. It's been a long time since \NI've worn a swimsuit, too. It was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:21.53,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It was fun, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:25.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I feel like I've embarrassed myself a bit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:29.82,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I need to regain my honor \Nas a senpai before bedtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:34.29,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:38.16,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Say "ahhh."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.16,0:13:40.54,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-Whoa, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:43.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, who gave Senpai booze?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:46.05,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come on, come on, "ahhh!"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.50,0:13:46.05,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,No one at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.55,0:13:48.09,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,No one stopped her, either, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.09,0:13:49.56,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Maybe you should have?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.56,0:13:52.18,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Don't you remember \Nwhat happened with the chocolates before?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.18,0:13:53.31,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-shan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.31,0:13:54.56,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,Smooch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.89,0:13:57.19,Flashback,Shiori,0,0,0,,I am so, so grateful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:14:01.34,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I guess that was a thing! Must've forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.34,0:14:03.05,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I seriously doubt you forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.23,0:14:07.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, man, my drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.15,0:14:08.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Oh, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:10.78,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Let me wipe that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.91,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-It's okay! I can handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:15.83,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:19.42,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Today, until bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.42,0:14:22.34,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Senpai is gonna take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:26.84,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,No, it's s-s-seriously fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:29.77,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Do you have an upset tummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:32.21,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I can rub it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:33.34,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,That's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.34,0:14:37.00,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Don't be shy now, come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,What's going on?! \NWhat kind of drunken behavior is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:40.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Does your tummy hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:41.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm telling you, it's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.87,0:14:44.59,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Does Katase-san get \Nmore intense when she's drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.98,0:14:46.48,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please stop! You can't! This is... too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.59,0:14:46.03,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.57,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Earlier, in the bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.48,0:14:47.57,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm really fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:51.54,Flashback,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I need to regain my honor \Nas a senpai before bedtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.37,0:14:54.81,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,After what she said...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:55.87,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Maybe that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:59.33,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I don't see what she has to \Nmake up for in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:15:01.37,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Turn this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.33,0:15:01.37,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,She probably just wants to show off a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.86,0:15:03.50,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,as your senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.91,0:15:10.38,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Okay, Shinozaki-san, let's wipe that mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.38,0:15:12.96,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have to admit, this situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:15.72,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's nice, but it's so awkward!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.27,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Hayakawa! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.27,0:15:20.02,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shinozaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.44,0:15:24.32,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I'm feeling like another dip in \Nthe open air bath, since we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.65,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Oh, me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:28.85,Main,Both,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:30.65,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.78,0:15:34.86,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san, say "ahhh" again...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.86,0:15:37.16,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm alone with Senpai \Nwhen she's acting like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.16,0:15:39.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.66,0:15:44.01,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll play along to the end \Nso she can go to bed satisfied!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.68,0:15:46.86,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Tastes good?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.86,0:15:48.42,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Tastes good...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.17,0:15:52.18,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,After dinner comes brushing teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.63,0:15:56.58,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,I can't brush them like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.80,0:15:59.40,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Right over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:01.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,O-O-On your lap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.43,0:16:04.32,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:05.60,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:08.19,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come forth, all of my restraint!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:11.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Once we're done, you'll go \Ngoosh goosh with your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.98,0:16:14.70,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}That onomatopoeia sounds kind of dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.86,0:16:18.70,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,What a nice brushing! Clap clap clap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.16,0:16:22.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}As nice as this is... I can't take much more...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.80,0:16:24.64,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,At this point, I just want to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.64,0:16:26.88,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you sweepy, Shinozaki-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:28.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.86,0:16:30.46,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.93,0:16:33.97,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Senpai will put you to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:43.98,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,I-I can't sleep yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.98,0:16:46.81,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's no good. No staying up late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.90,0:16:52.49,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Isn't it time for good boys to go to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.49,0:16:54.86,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}There is no chance I'm sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:00.28,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Huh, that's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.28,0:17:02.91,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I was sure I brought it with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.91,0:17:04.12,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,She forgot something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:05.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.08,0:17:09.75,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}If they show up now, \Nit's gonna be really annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.75,0:17:11.83,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,We'll celebrate with red bean breakfast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.71,0:17:14.32,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hello, Onee-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.32,0:17:16.01,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,What?! They're getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:18.26,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to avoid that at all costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.12,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Shinozaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.12,0:17:22.60,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Weird, the lights are off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:27.10,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,And they're both gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:29.37,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I wonder if they went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.37,0:17:31.80,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,We didn't run into them in the halls, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:34.20,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I hid without thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.20,0:17:36.61,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But if she forgot something, \Nthey'll probably leave soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.61,0:17:38.22,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.22,0:17:39.62,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,This is so weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.21,0:17:42.70,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I thought I put it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.70,0:17:47.12,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,The baths are separate anyway. \NYou can go on without me, Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.12,0:17:49.05,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,I'll wait. You can take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:51.13,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}You can't take your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.21,0:17:54.46,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.46,0:17:55.98,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.98,0:17:57.07,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:17:58.99,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I thought I heard a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.99,0:18:00.22,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Was it from outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.22,0:18:02.60,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I think it was from in the closet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.60,0:18:05.34,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:16.06,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's your special Senpai heating pad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.06,0:18:17.45,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,S-Senpai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.45,0:18:19.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Is it warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.57,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Yes, incredibly...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:23.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Wait, heating pad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:26.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That's right. Sneezing and sweating...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:28.08,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,You definitely need warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.14,0:18:31.58,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,It really is coming from in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.32,0:18:33.63,Italics,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:36.24,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Senpai heating pad!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:40.57,Main,Shinozkai,0,0,0,,W-W-Wait, now's not the time! Please, let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.57,0:18:43.35,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,It's an adhesive, and not going anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:47.32,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Feeling warm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.52,0:18:48.10,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap, crap, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:54.52,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai... please, quiet down for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:59.37,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Maybe you're imagining it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:19:00.61,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.16,0:19:04.43,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're saved...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.43,0:19:06.45,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.96,0:19:07.98,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Your hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.86,0:19:10.33,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Your hand's on my chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.24,0:19:16.68,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:17.77,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:21.13,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, \Na long time ago, this inn was where—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:22.39,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Stop it right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.48,0:19:26.30,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,We were enjoying this trip together...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:32.25,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Wait, is the reason \Nthey're missing because of ghosts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:34.90,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,We can't rule that out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:38.04,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What do we do?! \NCall the police?! An exorcist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.04,0:19:40.31,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,W-We need to find them, either way!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.22,0:19:40.87,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.34,0:19:45.99,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,That voice... Hayakawa-shan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:50.04,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-shan! I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.35,0:19:52.50,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai's going out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.81,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}What do I do, what do I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.76,0:20:00.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Hayakawa... san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:06.76,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,H-Huh? It's all dark...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.76,0:20:08.17,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:12.16,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hayakawa-san! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.79,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,We managed to avoid being found...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.41,0:20:18.58,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.99,0:20:23.66,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}I guess that wraps this up... I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.12,0:20:26.36,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Shinozaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:28.91,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.97,0:20:33.77,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Senpai, you're gonna catch a cold like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:35.42,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Let's get you in a futon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.42,0:20:37.02,Main,Shhiori,0,0,0,,'Kay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:43.68,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She was worried about \Nhow she came across before...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:48.10,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I'm glad I got to see \Na different side of you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.87,0:20:53.81,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:20:59.80,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}She won't let go...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.80,0:21:02.82,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, this is really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.02,0:21:05.05,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Right this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:06.82,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,There's a ghost in this room!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.27,0:21:18.25,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,Hello, Onee-san? \NPrepare some red beans and rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.25,0:21:19.71,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see. A wedding it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.71,0:21:21.32,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:23.39,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, what a glorious day!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.32,0:21:23.15,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,Uh, look, this is actually—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.15,0:21:25.39,Main,Hayakwa,0,0,0,,Where's the ghost? Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:26.99,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Senpai, could you wake up \Nand help me explain? Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.32,0:21:26.17,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,I better look into venues...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.37,0:21:27.97,Main,Hayakawa,0,0,0,,Wait, what was going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.99,0:21:29.90,Main,Akina,0,0,0,,{\an8}Oh, I actually know someone \Nwho can help with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.97,0:21:30.26,Main,Yutaka,0,0,0,,And I'll be aiding \Nwith dress selection, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.90,0:21:31.74,Main,Shiori,0,0,0,,{\an8}So much fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:32.97,Main,Shinozaki,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.30,0:21:50.18,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Bleary-eyed and not fully awake from a dream
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.18,0:21:55.08,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}I still can't bring myself \Nto drink that bitter coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:59.56,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}So I sneakily toss in \Ntwo pinches of a sweet secret
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:03.78,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}And let it slowly spread throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.00,0:22:08.74,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}There's a local bakery \Nthat's only open sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.74,0:22:13.63,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Where I once had some toast that glittered
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.29,0:22:18.13,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}What is it that makes it so satisfying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.13,0:22:22.30,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Almost like magic
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:27.38,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}I find myself thinking about that kind of thing
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.38,0:22:32.99,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}How the small things can be the most precious
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:37.78,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Deep inside my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.78,0:22:42.18,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's ever so bittersweet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.05,0:22:47.10,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Just being around you is enough"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.10,0:22:51.12,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Becomes my mantra
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:53.41,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Baby like sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.52,0:23:02.74,Italics,Lyrics,0,0,0,,{\an8}Baby you're the sugar
